### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets

### Create a new ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix the navigation bar",
  "description": "The links are broken on mobile devices."
}

### Update a ticket's status
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/6a26d1283efcb8427efc0d21
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### Delete a ticket
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/6a26d1283efcb8427efc0d21